Package: universal-battery-limiter
Version: 2.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1, gir1.2-notify-0.7, python3-tk, policykit-1
Maintainer: FrancyAlinston <francyalinston@example.com>
Description: Universal Battery Charge Limiting Tool
 Professional battery charge limiting tool for laptops running Ubuntu/Linux.
 Helps extend battery lifespan by preventing overcharging.
 .
 Features:
  - System tray integration with battery status display
  - GUI application with modern dark theme
  - CLI tools for command-line management
  - Multiple installation methods
  - Automatic updates through Ubuntu Software
  - Works with most laptop manufacturers that support ACPI battery control
 .
 This package provides multiple interfaces:
  - battery-cli: Interactive command-line interface
  - battery-limit: Simple CLI commands
  - battery-gui: Graphical user interface
  - battery-indicator: System tray indicator
